nd": 25, "expanded_url": "https://wa.me/13162084835", "start": 2, "unwound_url": "https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=13162084835&text&type=phone_number&app_absent=0", "url": "https://t.co/7NjrcSFYcB"}]}, "id": "2119174858479403357", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "👉 https://t.co/7NjrcSFYcB\n\nDon't Miss This Stock Research Discussion!\n\n$TSM\n$ASML\n$AVGO\nThese semiconductor-related companies operate in different parts of the technology supply chain. Understand their opportunities and risks.\n#Stocks #Semiconductors #AIStocks #Investing", "url": "https://x.com/Ux_abdulbasit/status/2119174858479403357"}, {"author_id": "250786007", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:23:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119178893420851284"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 183, "start": 178, "tag": "ASML"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "wa.me/12815157296", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://wa.me/12815157296", "start": 199, "unwound_url": "https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=12815157296&text&type=phone_number&app_absent=0", "url": "https://t.co/gm4anpIROd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/QY819rPOsN", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RyanCarter6936/status/2119178893420851284/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119178881278328832", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/QY819rPOsN"}]}, "id": "2119178893420851284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚀 I’ve set up a free stock trading discussion group—a high-quality space designed for traders who want to go beyond just watching price movements and engage in deeper analysis. \n$ASML\n\n👉 WhatsApp: [[https://t.co/gm4anpIROd]                                          \n\n🔥 Feel https://t.co/QY819rPOsN", "url": "https://x.com/RyanCarter6936/status/2119178893420851284"}, {"author_id": "2068839771015872512", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:55:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119186939563872624"], "id": "2119186939563872624", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国 AI 产业链，正在悄悄完成一次关键跃迁：从追赶一颗 GPU，到打造一整套自主算力体系。\n\n这可能是未来全球半导体产业格局最值得关注的变化之一。\n\n中国 AI 产业已经不再只是追赶 NVIDIA，而是在芯片设计、晶圆制造、存储、先进封装、高速互联等环节，逐步构建自己的产业链。", "url": "https://x.com/zzyxbt/status/2119186939563872624"}, {"author_id": "2081959403595710465", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:45:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119184380744847530"], "id": "2119184380744847530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nvidia reportedly asked TSMC, a logic-only foundry, to build a kind of memory that does not ship in volume until about 2030. TSMC would only say it does not comment on rumors. Read the ask, not the answer.", "url": "https://x.com/WaferBull/status/2119184380744847530"}, {"author_id": "2095946293034266624", "created_at": "2026-11-07T20:58:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119172688531063021"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 248, "start": 241, "tag": "Micron"}, {"end": 254, "start": 249, "tag": "DRAM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rDMNt7oZz5", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iCleanAI/status/2119172688531063021/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119172673112793088", "start": 255, "url": "https://t.co/rDMNt7oZz5"}]}, "id": "2119172688531063021", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DRAM prices will be up 400% from 2024 by the end of this year, per a JPMorgan report Engadget cites, and AI data centers are projected to take about 70% of the world's DRAM this year.\n\nMicron has reportedly sold 75% of its 2027 HBM output.\n\n#Micron #DRAM https://t.co/rDMNt7oZz5", "url": "https://x.com/iCleanAI/status/2119172688531063021"}, {"author_id": "1614608796973928448", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:15:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119177014649242006"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CWT5LNBoGq", "end": 197, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2119177014649242006/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119177011906179072", "start": 174, "url": "https://t.co/CWT5LNBoGq"}]}, "id": "2119177014649242006", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "마이크론이 대만 타오위안 신규 공장 공사를 사실상 멈춰다.\n\n투자 규모 30억에서 45억 달러 정도였고 2028년 HBM 생산을 노렸는데 노조가 영업이익 15% 배분을 요구하면서 협상이 길어졌다.\n\n대만이 마이크론 전체 D램의 60%를 맡고 있어서 중장기 공급에 변수가 생기다.\n\n삼성과 SK는 이미 2027년 https://t.co/CWT5LNBoGq", "url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2119177014649242006"}, {"author_id": "1588731443513008130", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:31:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119180926521598315"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dHToZosxRe", "end": 88, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceExpand/status/2119180926521598315/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119180892451360768", "start": 65, "url": "https://t.co/dHToZosxRe"}, {"display_url": "x.com/kalshi_finance…", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/kalshi_finance/status/2119096608109613098", "start": 89, "url": "https://t.co/zpmSrnEilA"}]}, "id": "2119180926521598315", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1798, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119096608109613098", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Nvidia vs AMD vs TSMC: where would you have put $10,000 in 1999? https://t.co/dHToZosxRe https://t.co/zpmSrnEilA", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceExpand/status/2119180926521598315"}, {"author_id": "268835065", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:58:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119187829448458549"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "米ネットメディアのジ・イ